er" background="textures/row3.jpg">Street Smarts </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases agility and strength. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Rogue </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Gouge </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">High damage Frontal Attack with increased hate. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Rogue</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Bludgeon </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">A quick attack that knocks down the enemy. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Rogue</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">16 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Strangling Shot </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Requires a ranged weapon. Launches two shots at once and reduces enemy power. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Rogue </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">17 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Self Preservation </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Lowers attack rate and gives you a chance to proc a decrease in hate. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Rogue</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">17 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Snoop </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Allows improved stealthed movement. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Rogue</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">18 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Fancy Footwork </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Greatly increases parry skill. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Rogue </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Smuggler&#39;s Talent </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Allows the rogue to move in stealth with little to no movement penalty. 60 sec recast 3 sec cast. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Rogue</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Distracting Blade </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">A flank attack that deals medium damage and interrupts an enemy. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Brigand</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Clobber </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Sometimes a quick whack to the back of the head is the best way to let someone know they&#39;re not doing things right. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Brigand </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Rake </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">An attack that lowers a targets agility. It must be activated from behind an enemy. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Brigand</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Ruse </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">A cunning attempt to trick the target. The brigand gains the creature&#39;s attention and launches a surprise attack when the creature strikes. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Brigand</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Tangling Strike </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">A high damage stealth attack that snares the enemy. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Brigand </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Knockaround </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Decreases enemy defense and agility. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Brigand</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Blackjack </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Stuns the target on a successful hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Brigand</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3